WinHub bundles the following third-party software.

================================================================================
MediaRemoteAdapter
https://github.com/ungive/mediaremote-adapter

Vendored in Resources/MediaRemoteAdapter/ (mediaremote-adapter.pl,
MediaRemoteAdapter.framework, MediaRemoteAdapterTestClient) and bundled into
WinHub.app. Used by the Dynamic notch module to read system-wide now-playing
state and send transport commands on macOS 15.4+.

